WEBVTT

00:07:59.929 --> 00:08:01.848
Kako sam obučen?

00:08:01.848 --> 00:08:04.739
(Smeh)

00:08:04.739 --> 00:08:10.550
(Aplauz)

00:08:11.247 --> 00:08:12.899
Pažnja je moćna stvar.

00:08:12.899 --> 00:08:15.698
Kao što sam rekao,
oblikuje vašu realnost.

00:08:15.698 --> 00:08:18.319
Zato bih želeo
da vam postavim to pitanje.

00:08:18.319 --> 00:08:20.740
Ako biste mogli
da kontrolišete nečiju pažnju,

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.409
šta biste uradili s njom?

00:08:22.409 --> 00:08:23.711
Hvala.

00:08:23.711 --> 00:08:29.382
(Aplauz)